          "reason": "The only implementation path imports price through the public core interface and does not introduce storage access or cycles. The maintained native command passed before and after on the same approved acceptance assertions. The contract was reviewed and already maps this route to every applicable rule and authoritative document; it requires no change. This portable assessment covers the committed implementation against the selected ancestor and will be committed separately before fresh standalone local and isolated-clone validation. The historical audit is left intact and final readiness is recorded in scratch. No exception, changed acceptance or owner decision is needed.",
